  ('making-room-for-rest', 294, 'Stop working the moment you notice you are rereading the same sentence, and take ten minutes away.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 295, 'Rest during a long drive by pulling into a rest area, stretching, and sitting still before you go on.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 296, 'Let the morning coffee be the only thing you do for the first ten minutes today.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 297, 'Spend a slow hour in a bookstore, a record shop, or a thrift store this weekend with nothing to buy.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 298, 'Choose a rest that costs nothing today: sitting, breathing, lying down, looking outside.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 299, 'Sit with a cool drink on a summer evening and let the day''s heat and hurry drain out of you.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 300, 'Ask someone you trust to remind you to take a break today, and thank them when they do.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 301, 'Rest by doing something with your hands tonight, such as kneading dough, sorting buttons, or shelling peas.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 302, 'Leave the group chat unread for an evening and rest from the pull to keep up.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 303, 'Stand still in the middle of a busy place today, a station, a store, a sidewalk, and take three breaths.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 304, 'Give yourself a slow reentry after time off: no meetings, no big decisions, just easing back for a morning.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 305, 'Sit in a warm laundromat, a library, or a cafe on a stormy day and let the weather keep you still.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 306, 'Let the afternoon slump be a signal to rest for ten minutes, not a problem to power through.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 307, 'Set a timer for one hour of undisturbed rest this weekend and let the household know it is yours.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 308, 'Rest in the shade of a building, an umbrella, or a tree during a lunchtime walk on a bright day.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 309, 'Write one sentence tonight about how rest changed today, even a little, and leave it there.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 310, 'Rest with a heating pad, a warm towel, or a hot water bottle on your shoulders for ten minutes tonight.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 311, 'Take the first warm day of spring as a reason to eat lunch outside and stay a little longer than usual.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 312, 'Pick one meeting this week you can attend without speaking, and let others carry it.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 313, 'Ask your body at three o''clock today what it needs, and give it five minutes of exactly that.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 314, 'Try sitting in the back seat, the passenger seat, or on the train instead of driving today, and rest on the way.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 315, 'Rest on a Sunday afternoon by doing the slowest version of whatever you would normally do.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 316, 'Let a slow cooker, a delivery app, or a freezer meal do the work tonight so you can sit down earlier.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 317, 'Spend fifteen minutes sitting in the yard, on a stoop, or at a window watching birds come and go.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 318, 'Trust that a task will still be there tomorrow, and put it down at a fixed time today.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 319, 'Sit in the sauna, the steam room, or a warm bath this winter and let the heat slow everything down.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 320, 'Notice how you talk about rest to other people today, and try describing it as necessary rather than earned.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 321, 'Leave the last errand undone this weekend and give that hour to a nap, a book, or a long sit.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 322, 'Rest with your back against a warm wall or a sunny window on a cold afternoon.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 323, 'Split one long task into two shorter ones today with a real break in between.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 324, 'Try a "slow Sunday" this week: no alarm, no list, and only what feels easy.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 325, 'Sit at the end of a pier, a dock, or a trail this summer and let the horizon hold your attention.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 326, 'Give yourself credit for resting today the way you would give yourself credit for finishing something.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 327, 'Make the next fifteen minutes the least productive of your day, and mean it.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 328, 'Ask a coworker to take a walk with you at lunch, and agree to keep work out of the conversation.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 329, 'Rest beside a sleeping pet, a napping child, or a quiet partner for a few minutes and match their stillness.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 330, 'Let the phone ring out once today instead of leaping for it, and finish your breath first.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 331, 'Sit in a quiet chapel, a garden, or a museum gallery this week and stay until you feel your shoulders drop.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 332, 'Choose one thing to do badly this week so you have the energy to rest instead.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 333, 'Rest under a blanket on the porch on a crisp fall evening and watch your breath in the air.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 334, 'Take the last ten minutes of your lunch break to sit with your eyes closed, wherever you are.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 335, 'Try a slow drive on a country road, a quiet street, or an empty parking lot this weekend, just to be unhurried.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 336, 'Rest before you reply to a hard message today, even if the rest is only five minutes on the couch.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 337, 'Sit on a sun-warmed rock, a stone wall, or a park bench this spring and let the warmth seep in.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 338, 'Write down one way you could take a real break at work tomorrow, then set a reminder for it.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 339, 'Rest in the pause after a meal, a walk, or a shower instead of hurrying to the next thing.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 340, 'Ask a friend to hold you to one hour of rest this weekend, and check in with each other afterward.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 341, 'Rest in a cool basement, a shaded room, or a breezy spot on a humid summer afternoon.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 342, 'Let the kitchen stay messy after a slow dinner tonight and sit with the people or the quiet instead.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 343, 'Choose a rest you have never tried before, such as a hammock, a float, a quiet chapel, or a hilltop, and try it this month.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 344, 'Rest your shoulders by dropping them on purpose five times today, each time you notice they have crept up.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 345, 'Ask what you can leave off tomorrow''s list tonight, and cross it out before you go to bed.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 346, 'Spend the first five minutes of a work break just noticing where you are tense, and let it go where you can.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 347, 'Rest under a shade umbrella, a pergola, or a leafy tree during the heat of the day this summer.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 348, 'Take one meeting as a walk today, or turn one call into a slow stroll around the block.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 349, 'Watch snow fall, if you have it, or the winter light shift, for five minutes from a warm spot.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 350, 'Try leaving your desk for lunch three days in a row this week and notice which day feels easiest.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 351, 'Rest while dinner cooks tonight instead of doing another task, and stay sitting until it is done.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 352, 'Set aside a full weekend afternoon this season for a slow, restful activity you have been putting off.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 353, 'Rest by watching someone else work for a minute today: a baker, a barista, a gardener, a mechanic.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 354, 'Let a slow morning stretch into a slow midday this weekend without correcting course.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 355, 'Rest in the quiet after the household goes to bed or before it wakes, for ten minutes, doing nothing.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 356, 'Say "not right now" to one request for your attention today, and follow up when you are rested.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 357, 'Rest on the bleachers, a bench, or a low wall this spring while someone else plays or practices.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 358, 'Try a slow shower with the lights low and the water a little warmer than usual tonight.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 359, 'Give yourself the last hour of the weekend to rest instead of preparing for the week ahead.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 360, 'Lean on a railing, a fence, or a gate for a few minutes today and just look at what is in front of you.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 361, 'Choose the most restful seat on the bus, the train, or in the office today and sit there on purpose.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 362, 'Rest in a doorway, on a threshold, or at the top of a hill this fall and watch the light change for a few minutes.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 363, 'Tell yourself "I have done enough for today" at a set time tonight, and let that be true.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 364, 'Look for the small rests that are already in your day, a wait, a walk, a quiet minute, and let them count.'),
  ('making-room-for-rest', 365, 'Plan your next real break, a day or a weekend, and put the first step in motion this week.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 1, 'Write down five words that describe the person you want to be.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 2, 'Pick one of your values and do one small thing today that expresses it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 3, 'Think of a person you admire and write down which of their qualities you want more of.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 4, 'Notice one moment today when you acted in line with what you care about. Name the value.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 5, 'Write down one thing you spend time on that does not match your values, and one small change.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 6, 'Ask yourself: "If today were a chapter, what would I want it to be about?" Then live one page of it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 7, 'Do something today for a cause, a person, or a place you care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 8, 'Choose one value and put it somewhere you will see it all day.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 9, 'Write down what you would want a friend to say about you at your eightieth birthday.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 10, 'Make one decision today based on what matters, not on what is easiest.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 11, 'Spend fifteen minutes on something that feels meaningful rather than urgent.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 12, 'List three moments in your life when you felt most yourself. What did they have in common?'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 13, 'Say what you think today in one conversation where you would normally keep quiet.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 14, 'Notice one value you have been neglecting and give it ten minutes today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 15, 'Write a sentence that starts with "I want to be the kind of person who..."'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 16, 'Pick one relationship and do one thing that reflects how much it matters to you.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 17, 'Spend money, even a little, on something that matches your values instead of a habit.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 18, 'Notice when you feel proud today and write down what value you were honoring.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 19, 'Do one thing today that your younger self would be glad to see you doing.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 20, 'Write down one value you hold that you rarely talk about, and tell someone about it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 21, 'Turn one value into a tiny daily action: "kindness" becomes "one warm message a day."'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 22, 'Choose how you want to show up in one meeting or gathering today, and do it on purpose.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 23, 'Notice one thing you do out of habit, and ask whether it reflects who you want to be.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 24, 'Write down one value you got from your family and whether you want to keep it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 25, 'Do a small act of courage today in the direction of something you care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 26, 'Spend ten minutes learning about something you value, a skill, a place, a cause.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 27, 'Write down what "a good day" looks like for you, in three lines.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 28, 'Let one value guide how you treat yourself today, not just others.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 29, 'Notice a moment today when you were pulled away from your values, and gently return.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 30, 'Look back over this challenge and write down the two or three values that came up most. Those are yours.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 31, 'Name the value behind your morning routine, then adjust one small part of it to match that value better.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 32, 'Before you open your phone this morning, say out loud one thing you want your day to stand for.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 33, 'Look at your calendar for the week and circle the one commitment that matters most to you. Protect it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 34, 'Write down a value you admire in a coworker and find one way to bring it into your own work today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 35, 'Cancel or shorten one thing today that you agreed to only out of obligation, and use the time on something you care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 36, 'Take a ten-minute walk and ask yourself what you would do with your time if no one were watching.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 37, 'Choose a book, podcast, or article that speaks to something you care about and give it twenty minutes tonight.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 38, 'Pick a value and write three ways you could express it at work, then try the smallest one before lunch.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 39, 'Text a friend and ask what they think you care most about. Compare their answer with your own.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 40, 'Notice which of your values shows up in how you handle money this week, and write it down.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 41, 'Cook or order a meal that reflects something you believe in, whether that is health, community, or the local farm.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 42, 'Write a short note to yourself about why your job matters, beyond the paycheck, and keep it in your wallet.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 43, 'Say no to one request today so that you can say yes to something that matters more.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 44, 'Rank your top five values from most to least lived this month, then give the last one twenty minutes.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 45, 'Ask an older relative or friend what they wish they had spent more time on, and sit with the answer.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 46, 'Pick one object in your home that represents a value you hold. Move it somewhere you will see it more.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 47, 'Spend your lunch break doing one thing that lines up with what you care about rather than scrolling.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 48, 'Write down a decision you are avoiding, then list which of your values each option honors.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 49, 'Set a timer for five minutes and list everything you did yesterday that felt like it was truly yours.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 50, 'Pick one value and let it choose your evening plan tonight.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 51, 'Catch yourself saying yes on autopilot today. Ask what you would have chosen on purpose.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 52, 'Write a one-line mission statement for the next week and read it before you start work.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 53, 'Look at how you spent money in the last seven days and mark each purchase with the value it served, if any.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 54, 'Clean or organize one small space in a way that reflects how you want to live, not how you have been living.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 55, 'Choose one small daily habit and connect it to a value in writing: "I make my bed because I value calm."'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 56, 'Reach out to someone who shares a value with you and suggest doing something about it together.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 57, 'Write down one thing you want to be remembered for, then do a five-minute version of it today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 58, 'When envy shows up today, ask what value it is pointing to, and take one step toward it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 59, 'Sit outside for ten minutes and ask what kind of life you want to build. Write down the first honest answer.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 60, 'Pick a value you hold about the environment and change one household habit today to match it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 61, 'Decide what "enough" looks like for you in one area of life, and write it down where you will see it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 62, 'Do the task you have been putting off that matters most to you, even if only for fifteen minutes.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 63, 'Practice listening in one conversation today the way a person you admire listens.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 64, 'Ask yourself what you would want your work to be about if the title did not matter, then do one hour of that.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 65, 'Write down the three things you would keep doing if you won the lottery. Do one of them this evening.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 66, 'Choose a value to lead with in your next hard conversation, and plan one sentence that expresses it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 67, 'Spend twenty minutes on a hobby you dropped because it felt unproductive, and notice what it gives you.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 68, 'Notice one place where you spend energy pleasing others, and reclaim ten minutes of it for what you value.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 69, 'Write down what you believe about rest, then take a break today that matches that belief.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 70, 'Pick a value and photograph one thing today that represents it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 71, 'List three ways your weekends could reflect your values more, and schedule one for this weekend.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 72, 'Ask a family member what they think the household stands for, and compare it with what you would like it to stand for.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 73, 'Volunteer an hour this month for something that reflects what you care about, and put the date on your calendar today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 74, 'Choose one purchase you are considering and wait a day. Ask whether it serves a value or fills a gap.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 75, 'Write a short list of what you will not do for money, and notice how it feels to see it in writing.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 76, 'Spend five minutes at the end of your workday naming which of your values showed up and which did not.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 77, 'Do one thing today that supports your health because you value being around for the people you love.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 78, 'Notice a moment when you felt resentful today. Ask which value was being stepped on, and speak up for it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 79, 'Reread something you wrote about your values earlier and update it with one thing you have learned since.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 80, 'Pick one relationship that has drifted and send a message that reflects how much it once mattered.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 81, 'Write down which of your values are easiest to live at home and which are easiest at work, then swap one.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 82, 'Choose one meeting today to speak from your values rather than from what will be popular.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 83, 'Give ten minutes this evening to a creative project that means something to you, with no goal of finishing.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 84, 'Plan one small adventure for the coming month that reflects your curiosity, and take the first step to book it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 85, 'Look at your last ten photos and ask what they say about what you value. Take one photo today on purpose.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 86, 'Practice saying "That matters to me" once today in a conversation where you would usually stay vague.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 87, 'Write down one boundary you want to hold this week and the value it protects.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 88, 'Spend an hour offline this evening on something that would make your future self grateful.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 89, 'Notice which of your values feels most alive in the morning and which in the evening. Arrange today accordingly.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 90, 'Ask yourself what you would teach a child about how to live, then follow one piece of that advice today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 91, 'Choose a value and let it decide how you respond to the next mistake you make.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 92, 'Write a letter you may never send to someone who shaped your values, thanking them for one specific lesson.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 93, 'Turn off notifications for two hours and spend that quiet time on one thing that reflects who you want to be.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 94, 'Take a different route today, on foot or by car, and use the time to think about what you want more of in your life.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 95, 'Pick one value you hold about learning and register for, read about, or ask about one thing that expresses it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 96, 'If you catch yourself comparing your life to someone else today, return to your own list of what matters.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 97, 'Make your to-do list for tomorrow, then add one item that is there only because it matters to you.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 98, 'Ask a close friend what they think you would never compromise on, and see if you agree.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 99, 'Find a quote that captures one of your values and write it on a sticky note for your workspace.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 100, 'Spend fifteen minutes in nature and ask yourself what you are protecting by the way you live.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 101, 'Write down what you would do this Saturday if it were entirely up to you, and put one piece of it into the actual plan.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 102, 'Notice the first time today you feel bored, and ask whether the task is empty or just disconnected from what you care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 103, 'Pick a value and find one song that captures it. Play it on your way to work.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 104, 'Ask yourself which of your values you would defend in public, and which you keep private. Choose one to share today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 105, 'Choose one household chore and do it as an expression of care for the people you live with, not as a burden.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 106, 'Write down the last time you felt truly proud of yourself, and identify the value you were living in that moment.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 107, 'Spend ten minutes this evening planning tomorrow around one value instead of around your inbox.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 108, 'Reflect on a recent argument and write down which value you were defending. Decide whether it was worth defending that way.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 109, 'Draft a short "values budget" for the week: how many hours you want to give to family, health, learning, and creativity.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 110, 'Find one recurring meeting or appointment that drains you and ask whether it serves anything you value. Adjust or accept it on purpose.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 111, 'Name the value that gets you out of bed on hard mornings, and write it on a card for your nightstand.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 112, 'Tell a coworker one thing you appreciate about the way they work, because you value good work being seen.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 113, 'Choose one item to donate or give away today because owning it no longer reflects who you are.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 114, 'Set aside thirty minutes this weekend for the one activity that makes you feel most like yourself.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 115, 'Answer this in writing: what do you want your home to feel like to a guest? Change one small thing toward that.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 116, 'Decline one piece of gossip today because you value being someone people can trust.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 117, 'Write down two values that sometimes conflict for you, like ambition and family, and decide which leads today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 118, 'Check in with your body at noon and ask whether the way you are working matches how you want to treat yourself.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 119, 'Practice patience in one line, one traffic jam, or one slow conversation today because it reflects who you want to be.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 120, 'Ask a mentor or older colleague what values guided their best decisions, and write down one you want to borrow.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 121, 'Take one step, however small, toward a long-held goal that you have been calling "someday."'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 122, 'Notice what you talk about most with friends this week and ask whether it reflects what you actually care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 123, 'Spend the first ten minutes of your workday on the task that matters most, before email pulls you elsewhere.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 124, 'Write down the one value you would want your children, or the young people in your life, to learn from watching you.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 125, 'Give one hour this weekend to a community space, a library, park, or local shop, because you value where you live.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 126, 'Say something honest and kind to yourself in the mirror this morning that reflects the person you are becoming.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 127, 'Look back at a choice you regret and write down which value you ignored. Forgive yourself and carry the lesson forward.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 128, 'Pick an evening this week to eat without screens, because you value being present with whoever is at the table, even if it is just you.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 129, 'Write down where you feel most at peace, and plan a visit there within the month.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 130, 'Turn one complaint you have made recently into an action that reflects what you would rather see.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 131, 'Take a fifteen-minute walk after dinner and ask what your life would look like if you fully trusted your own values.'),
