  ('living-by-your-values', 133, 'Let one of your values pick what you read, watch, or listen to tonight.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 134, 'Notice which of your values you protect fiercely and which you let slide. Give the neglected one a small win today.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 135, 'Write down a compliment you received recently and ask which value it recognized in you.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 136, 'Make a two-column list: what you say matters, and where your hours actually go. Pick one line to bring closer together.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 137, 'Cook one meal from scratch this week because you value slowing down, and notice how it feels to make time for it.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 138, 'Let a value guide your reply to one email today, choosing honesty, warmth, or clarity on purpose.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 139, 'Remove one app from your home screen that pulls you away from what you care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 140, 'Go to bed thirty minutes earlier tonight because you value showing up rested for tomorrow.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 141, 'Spend a coffee break thinking about what you want the next year to be about, and write one sentence.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 142, 'Ask someone you trust to name a moment when they saw you at your best. Notice which value they describe.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 143, 'Name the value that costs you the most and whether you are still willing to pay that price.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 144, 'Tidy your workspace in a way that reflects your values, keeping only what supports the work you care about.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 145, 'Spend fifteen minutes on a skill you value more than the one your job rewards.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 146, 'Say "I need to think about that" today instead of agreeing on the spot, so your answer can come from your values.'),
