  ('living-by-your-values', 208, 'Choose your first task of the morning based on what matters, not on what arrived last.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 209, 'Write a two-sentence note about why you do your work, and put it where you sit down each day.'),
  ('living-by-your-values', 210, 'Notice which value you lean on under stress, and thank yourself for having it.'),
